  permkey), <type>, <bemonsterdObject> naming the boring, the instrument and
  sample type as codelist URIs, <bemonsteringsplaats><van>/<tot>, the date.
  The <observatie> shape is the per-observation download the bbox grain-size
  import parses (dov_grain_size_parser docstring, verified live 2026-05-08).
